# AI

AI generates Kit Recipes. AI NEVER generates audio. AI returns JSON, which maps onto installed samples.

## Flow

```
Prompt → AI Recipe → Validate → Sample Search → KitModel → React
```

- Always validate AI JSON before applying it.
- Map recipes onto existing installed samples; never synthesize or invent audio.
- The resulting `KitModel` is authoritative; React only renders it.
